            "title": "Guy Fawkes - Wikipedia",
            "quote": "Fawkes admitted his intention to blow up the House of Lords"
          }
        ],
        "confidence": "high"
      },
      {
        "id": "c2",
        "text": "Celebrating that the king had survived, people lit bonfires around London; 5 November became an annual day of thanksgiving.",
