            "title": "Guy Fawkes Night - Wikipedia",
            "quote": "Celebrating that the king had survived, people lit bonfires around London."
          }
        ],
        "confidence": "high"
      },
      {
        "id": "c3",
        "text": "The 'guy' is normally created by children from old clothes, newspapers and a mask; children begged for a 'penny for the guy'.",
