          {
            "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Guy_Fawkes_Night",
            "title": "Guy Fawkes Night - Wikipedia"
          }
        ],
        "confidence": "high"
      },
      {
        "id": "c4",
        "text": "'Guy' was coined from the name of Guy Fawkes and came to refer to the effigies burned on Guy Fawkes Night.",
        "sources": [
          {
            "url": "https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/guy",
